{"seq":3,"slug":"midi-expression","title":"MIDI 控制与表达映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/midi-expression","wordCount":1455,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"midi-控制与表达映射\">MIDI 控制与表达映射</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MIDI 不只是音符的搬运工，它承载了丰富的演奏数据，是把&quot;演奏者的意图&quot;翻译为&quot;合成器参数变化&quot;的桥梁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>消息类型即调制可能</strong>：Velocity、Aftertouch、Mod Wheel、Pitch Bend、CC 各自对应用途不同的实时调制。</li>\n<li><strong>响应曲线决定手感</strong>：原始 0–127 的值需经线性/指数/对数/S 形曲线映射，才符合演奏直觉。</li>\n<li><strong>MPE 实现每音符独立表达</strong>：通过 MIDI 通道分配，为每个音符提供独立的 Pitch/Pressure/Slide。</li>\n<li><strong>宏控制汇总多参数</strong>：一个旋钮绑定多个参数，创造复合的音色变化。</li>\n<li><strong>可演奏性是设计目标</strong>：好的音色在无控制器时也好听，在满控制器时能到达极端但可用的表现力。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"midi-作为调制源\">MIDI 作为调制源</h2><p>MIDI（Musical Instrument Digital Interface）不仅传递音符信息，还携带丰富的表演数据，可作为合成器的实时调制源。每个 MIDI 消息类型对应不同的调制可能性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MIDI 调制值</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>127</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>归一化</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MIDI 调制值} \\in [0, 127] \\to \\text{归一化} \\in [0.0, 1.0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MIDI </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调制值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">127</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">归一化</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>MIDI 消息</th>\n<th>数据范围</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>典型调制用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Note Velocity</td>\n<td>0–127</td>\n<td>每次触发</td>\n<td>力度→Cutoff/Amp/Env Amount</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aftertouch (Channel)</td>\n<td>0–127</td>\n<td>按压持续</td>\n<td>压力→Vibrato/Brightness</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poly Aftertouch</td>\n<td>0–127/音符</td>\n<td>每键独立</td>\n<td>精细表情控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mod Wheel (CC1)</td>\n<td>0–127</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>Vibrato Depth/FX Amount</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pitch Bend</td>\n<td>-8192–8191</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>音高弯曲 ±2–12 半音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expression (CC11)</td>\n<td>0–127</td>\n<td>手动/自动化</td>\n<td>音量表情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Breath (CC2)</td>\n<td>0–127</td>\n<td>吹奏控制器</td>\n<td>管乐表情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sustain (CC64)</td>\n<td>0 or 127</td>\n<td>踏板</td>\n<td>延音开关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph MIDI源[&quot;MIDI 源&quot;]&#10;        V[&quot;Velocity&lt;br/&gt;0-127&quot;]&#10;        AT[&quot;Aftertouch&lt;br/&gt;0-127&quot;]&#10;        MW[&quot;Mod Wheel&lt;br/&gt;CC1&quot;]&#10;        PB[&quot;Pitch Bend&lt;br/&gt;14-bit&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 映射[&quot;调制映射&quot;]&#10;        M[&quot;Mod Matrix&lt;br/&gt;Amount/Curve&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 目标[&quot;合成器参数&quot;]&#10;        F[&quot;Filter Cutoff&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;Amp Level&quot;]&#10;        P[&quot;Pitch&quot;]&#10;        L[&quot;LFO Depth&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    V --&gt; M&#10;    AT --&gt; M&#10;    MW --&gt; M&#10;    PB --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; F&#10;    M --&gt; A&#10;    M --&gt; P&#10;    M --&gt; L\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph MIDI源[\"MIDI 源\"]\n        V[\"Velocity&lt;br/&gt;0-127\"]\n        AT[\"Aftertouch&lt;br/&gt;0-127\"]\n        MW[\"Mod Wheel&lt;br/&gt;CC1\"]\n        PB[\"Pitch Bend&lt;br/&gt;14-bit\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 映射[\"调制映射\"]\n        M[\"Mod Matrix&lt;br/&gt;Amount/Curve\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 目标[\"合成器参数\"]\n        F[\"Filter Cutoff\"]\n        A[\"Amp Level\"]\n        P[\"Pitch\"]\n        L[\"LFO Depth\"]\n    end\n    V --&gt; M\n    AT --&gt; M\n    MW --&gt; M\n    PB --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; F\n    M --&gt; A\n    M --&gt; P\n    M --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"velocity-映射与响应曲线\">Velocity 映射与响应曲线</h2><p>Velocity 是最基础的表达控制——它在每次按键时传递&quot;用力程度&quot;。原始值 0–127 通过响应曲线（Response Curve）映射为调制输出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Velocity</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>127</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Output} = f_{curve}(\\text{Velocity} / 127)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Velocity</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/127</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线类型</th>\n<th>数学</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>均匀响应</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻触不响应，重击突然</td>\n<td>打击乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\sqrt{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻触也有响应</td>\n<td>弱奏表现力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S 形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = 3x^2 - 2x^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中间敏感两端缓</td>\n<td>人声表情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>忽略力度</td>\n<td>Organ 风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = 1 - x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻触=最大</td>\n<td>特殊效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多重 Velocity 分层（Velocity Layer）——不同力度触发不同采样或合成参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>力度范围</th>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>音色变化</th>\n<th>物理对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1–40 (pp)</td>\n<td>Layer 1</td>\n<td>柔软/少泛音</td>\n<td>轻弹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41–80 (mf)</td>\n<td>Layer 2</td>\n<td>中等/正常</td>\n<td>正常弹奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>81–110 (f)</td>\n<td>Layer 3</td>\n<td>明亮/攻击性</td>\n<td>有力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>111–127 (ff)</td>\n<td>Layer 4</td>\n<td>极亮/机械噪声</td>\n<td>击打</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mpe-midi-polyphonic-expression\">MPE (MIDI Polyphonic Expression)</h2><p>MPE 是 MIDI 的多维表达扩展——为每个音符提供独立的 Pitch Bend、Pressure（滑动/压力）和 Slide（Y 轴），大幅超越传统 MIDI 的表达能力。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>传统 MIDI:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Per-channel 控制（所有音符共享）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{传统 MIDI:} \\quad \\text{Per-channel 控制（所有音符共享）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传统</span><span class=\"mord\"> MIDI:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Per-channel </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">控制（所有音符共享）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MPE:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Per-note 控制（每音符独立）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MPE:} \\quad \\text{Per-note 控制（每音符独立）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPE:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Per-note </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">控制（每音符独立）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 MIDI</th>\n<th>MPE</th>\n<th>控制器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pitch</td>\n<td>全局 Pitch Bend</td>\n<td>每音符独立弯曲</td>\n<td>ROLI Seaboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pressure</td>\n<td>Channel Aftertouch</td>\n<td>每音符独立压力</td>\n<td>Linnstrument</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slide (Y)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>每音符 Y 轴位置</td>\n<td>Sensel Morph</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Strike Velocity</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>有（更精确）</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lift Velocity</td>\n<td>有（少用）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MPE 使用 MIDI Channel 分配实现每音符独立——每个音符分配到不同的 MIDI 通道（通常 2–16），在各自通道上发送 Pitch Bend 和 CC：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Note 1</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Ch 2</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>PB</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>CC74</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>AT</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Note 1} \\to \\text{Ch 2}: \\quad \\text{PB}_{ch2}, \\text{CC74}_{ch2}, \\text{AT}_{ch2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Note 1</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ch 2</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PB</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CC74</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Note 2</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Ch 3</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>PB</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>CC74</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>AT</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Note 2} \\to \\text{Ch 3}: \\quad \\text{PB}_{ch3}, \\text{CC74}_{ch3}, \\text{AT}_{ch3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Note 2</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ch 3</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PB</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CC74</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 传统[&quot;传统 MIDI&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;所有音符&lt;br/&gt;共享 Pitch Bend&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;全局 Aftertouch&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph MPE[&quot;MPE&quot;]&#10;        M1[&quot;Note 1: 独立 PB + AT + Slide&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;Note 2: 独立 PB + AT + Slide&quot;]&#10;        M3[&quot;Note 3: 独立 PB + AT + Slide&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 传统[\"传统 MIDI\"]\n        T1[\"所有音符&lt;br/&gt;共享 Pitch Bend\"]\n        T2[\"全局 Aftertouch\"]\n    end\n    subgraph MPE[\"MPE\"]\n        M1[\"Note 1: 独立 PB + AT + Slide\"]\n        M2[\"Note 2: 独立 PB + AT + Slide\"]\n        M3[\"Note 3: 独立 PB + AT + Slide\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"宏控制与表演映射\">宏控制与表演映射</h2><p>宏控制（Macro Control）将多个参数绑定到单一控制源，允许用一个旋钮同时改变多个合成参数——创造复合的音色变化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Macro 设计</th>\n<th>绑定参数</th>\n<th>变化方向</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;明暗&quot;</td>\n<td>Filter Cutoff (+), HF EQ (+), Drive (+)</td>\n<td>同向增加</td>\n<td>整体变亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;空间&quot;</td>\n<td>Reverb Mix (+), Delay (+), Stereo (+)</td>\n<td>同向增加</td>\n<td>更远更宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;粗糙&quot;</td>\n<td>Drive (+), Noise (+), Cutoff (-)</td>\n<td>混合方向</td>\n<td>脏+闷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;运动&quot;</td>\n<td>LFO Rate (+), LFO Depth (+)</td>\n<td>同向增加</td>\n<td>更活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;变形&quot;</td>\n<td>WT Position (+), Filter Type</td>\n<td>形态变化</td>\n<td>音色转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Macro 的数学本质——单输入多输出的线性（或非线性）映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Param</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Base</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Macro</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>Amount</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>Curve</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Macro</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Param}_i = \\text{Base}_i + \\text{Macro} \\times \\text{Amount}_i \\times \\text{Curve}_i(\\text{Macro})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Param</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Macro</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Curve</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Macro</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"自动化与实时控制策略\">自动化与实时控制策略</h2><p>在 DAW 中使用合成器时，MIDI CC 自动化是音色动态变化的主要实现手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CC 自动化</td>\n<td>手绘/录制 CC 曲线</td>\n<td>精确可编辑</td>\n<td>电子制作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部 LFO</td>\n<td>合成器自带</td>\n<td>自包含、独立于 DAW</td>\n<td>Preset 设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件控制器</td>\n<td>MIDI Controller 实时操作</td>\n<td>有机/人性化</td>\n<td>现场表演</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达控制器</td>\n<td>MPE/Breath/Ribbon</td>\n<td>极高表现力</td>\n<td>独奏乐器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机化</td>\n<td>Random CC Generation</td>\n<td>不可预测的有机感</td>\n<td>氛围/实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>将合成器音色设计为&quot;可演奏&quot;的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可演奏性</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>力度响应</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>实时控制</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>反馈感知</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可演奏性} = \\text{力度响应} + \\text{实时控制} + \\text{反馈感知}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可演奏性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">力度响应</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实时控制</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">反馈感知</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计原则</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>力度控制亮度</td>\n<td>Vel→Filter Env</td>\n<td>弹奏力度有意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mod Wheel 控制表情</td>\n<td>MW→Vibrato + Brightness</td>\n<td>实时塑形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aftertouch 加深度</td>\n<td>AT→Filter/FX</td>\n<td>按下更深=更多效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然默认</td>\n<td>无控制器也好听</td>\n<td>初始可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端可达</td>\n<td>满控制器值=极端但可用</td>\n<td>表演空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;演奏者&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;力度 Velocity&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Mod Wheel&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Aftertouch&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Pitch Bend&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Filter/Amp&quot;| F[&quot;即时响应&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Vibrato/Brightness&quot;| G[&quot;实时塑形&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;FX/Filter&quot;| H[&quot;深度控制&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;Pitch&quot;| I[&quot;音高弯曲&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"演奏者\"] --&gt; B[\"力度 Velocity\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Mod Wheel\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Aftertouch\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Pitch Bend\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"Filter/Amp\"| F[\"即时响应\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"Vibrato/Brightness\"| G[\"实时塑形\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"FX/Filter\"| H[\"深度控制\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"Pitch\"| I[\"音高弯曲\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MIDI 消息类型（Velocity、Aftertouch、Mod Wheel、Pitch Bend、CC）各自对应不同的实时调制用途。</li>\n<li>Velocity 响应曲线把 0–127 的线性取值映射为符合演奏直觉的输出，并可叠加多层力度分层。</li>\n<li>MPE 通过 MIDI 通道分配，为每个音符提供独立的 Pitch、Pressure、Slide，超越传统 MIDI 的表达能力。</li>\n<li>宏控制把多个参数绑定到单一控制源，用一次操作创造复合的音色变化。</li>\n<li>&quot;可演奏性&quot;是设计目标：既要在无控制器时自然好听，也要在满控制器时保留表演空间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MIDI 控制与表达映射","id":"midi-控制与表达映射"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MIDI 作为调制源","id":"midi-作为调制源"},{"level":2,"text":"Velocity 映射与响应曲线","id":"velocity-映射与响应曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"MPE (MIDI Polyphonic Expression)","id":"mpe-midi-polyphonic-expression"},{"level":2,"text":"宏控制与表演映射","id":"宏控制与表演映射"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化与实时控制策略","id":"自动化与实时控制策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"调制矩阵与路由架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/mod-matrix"},"next":{"title":"音色设计工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/design-workflow"}}